<title>POLAND: Poland's Zielona Gora plans PLN 20 mln muni bond.</title>
<headline>Poland's Zielona Gora plans PLN 20 mln muni bond.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The western Polish town of Zielona Gora plans to issue up to 20 million zlotys of three-year municipal bonds in a private placement during the second quarter of 1997, the issue's manager said.</p>
<p>Bank Handlowy SA said the coupon of the bond will likely be the average yield of the 52-week T-bills from the four primary tenders preceding the issue.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
